---
// Responsive grid for Feature.astro items on the front page.
---

<div class="feature-grid not-content"><slot /></div>

<style>
  .feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 17rem), 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-block: 1.5rem 0;
  }
</style>
